# A member is a user who holds a role in an organization, and so sees and
# may do what that role permits there. Members of an organization are
# listed by whoever belongs to it; administrators decide who belongs and in
# which role.
#
# A role can run out on a date, an organization always keeps at least one
# administrator, and anyone may leave. A role opens the organization's data
# to whoever controls the address it was given to, so only verified
# addresses can be given one.
module Accounts::Organizations::Members
end
